### ScoutBite 联调用例（VS Code 装 REST Client 插件，点击 Send Request 即可执行）
### 联调顺序出自《接口实现》：注册→建店→审核→上架→领券→下单→支付→评价→推荐→超时回补
### 阶段：接口全部是骨架占位，返回 todo 提示；此文件先立「流程」，后续每天逐步变绿

@host = http://localhost:8081
@agent = http://localhost:8000

### ① 注册三个角色：用户 A / 商家 B / 管理员 C（返回真 token）
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "pass-1234",
  "role": "USER",
  "nickname": "用户A"
}

### ② B 创建店铺提交审核（状态机 pending）
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "pass-1234",
  "role": "MERCHANT",
  "nickname": "商家B"
}

### ③ C（管理员）审核通过（；演示用快捷通道）
POST {{host}}/api/admin/shops/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ④ nearby 查到已审核的店（距离排序）
GET {{host}}/api/shops/nearby?lat=30.2741&lng=120.1551&radius=3000&category=HOTPOT

### ⑤ B 上架套餐（）
POST {{host}}/api/merchant/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "title": "双人烤鱼套餐",
  "price": 19800,
  "stock": 50
}

### ⑥ A 领券（Lua 原子扣减）
POST {{host}}/api/coupons/1/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ⑦ A 下单（注意 Idempotency-Key 头，幂等）
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 1,
  "couponId": 1
}

### ⑧ A 支付（）
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ⑨ A 生成评价草稿（；走门面转发 agent-api）
POST {{host}}/api/agent/user/review-draft
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "userNote": "排队久但红油很香，店员主动加水",
  "imageKeys": ["minio/a.jpg"],
  "preferScores": {"taste": 5, "wait": 2}
}

### ⑩ A 确认发布草稿（签字权在用户，）
POST {{host}}/api/agent/user/review-draft/d-000/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ⑪ A 对话式推荐（LangGraph）
POST {{host}}/api/agent/user/recommend
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "今晚想吃辣的，两个人，人均100左右",
  "lat": 30.2741,
  "lng": 120.1551
}

### ⑫ B 商家分析：skill=ops（）
POST {{host}}/api/agent/merchant/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "skill": "ops"
}

### ⑬ Agent 服务健康检查（直连，仅联调/验收用）
GET {{agent}}/health

### ⑭ Agent 推荐骨架（直测 agent-api；上线后前端不直连此服务）
POST {{agent}}/agent/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "今晚想吃辣的",
  "lat": 30.2741,
  "lng": 120.1551
}

### ⑮ 再下一单不支付，等超时后查库存回补（关单场景）
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: order-timeout-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 1
}
